## What NOT to Do
- Never use verbs in URLs (`/createUser`, `/deleteUser`)
- Never nest deeper than 2 levels (`/users/{id}/orders/{id}/items/{id}` is forbidden)
- Never return 500 for client errors (use 4xx codes)
- Never expose stack traces in production error responses
